  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Expanding the determinant,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mo>&#8658;</mo> </math> <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mo>&#8658;</mo> </math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>